  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eotephradactylus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Eotephradactylus\">Eotephradactylus mcintireae</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype (<b>PEFO 53384</b>) and referred (<b>PEFO 53536</b>, <b>54092</b>, <b>52926</b>) specimens. All specimens scale to individuals of a comparable size. Scale bar=10 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b> = Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 53384)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#F2D5DA\" title=\"#F2D5DA\"> </b> = Referred  <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 53536)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#E5ACB5\" title=\"#E5ACB5\"> </b> = Referred  <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 54092)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#D88290\" title=\"#D88290\"> </b> = Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 52926)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b> = Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1073%2Fpnas.2505513122\">\"Unusual bone bed reveals a vertebrate community with pterosaurs and turtles in equatorial Pangaea before the end-Triassic extinction\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.7717/peerj.7363\">\"<i>Seazzadactylus venieri</i> gen. et sp. nov., a new pterosaur (Diapsida: Pterosauria) from the Upper Triassic (Norian) of northeastern Italy\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/sassypaleonerd/art/Seazzadactylus-Skeletal-807061418\"><i>Seazzadactylus</i> skeletal</a> by Dean Schnabel</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038%2Fs41559-018-0627-y\">\"<i>Caelestiventus hanseni</i> gen. et sp. nov. extends the desert-dwelling pterosaur record back 65 million years\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dx.doi.org/10.4072/paleodest.2022.37.77.04\">\"De galho em galho — Lagerpetidae &amp; a origem dos pterossauros\"</a></li></ul>",
